---
to: docs/GALL_STATUS_LEDGER.md
force: true
sparql:
  standings: |
    PREFIX gall: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/gall-core#>
    SELECT ?checkpointId ?title ?crownId ?standing ?revision ?runner ?witness ?falsifier ?receipt ?replay WHERE {
      ?checkpoint a gall:Checkpoint ;
                  gall:checkpointId ?checkpointId ;
                  gall:title ?title .
      OPTIONAL {
        ?crown a gall:Crown ;
               gall:crownId ?crownRaw ;
               gall:includesCheckpoint ?checkpoint .
      }
      OPTIONAL {
        ?evidence a gall:CheckpointEvidence ;
                  gall:forCheckpoint ?checkpoint .
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:runnerExitCode ?runnerRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:witnessExitCode ?witnessRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:falsifierExitCode ?falsifierRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:receiptExitCode ?receiptRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:replayExitCode ?replayRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:exactRevision ?revisionRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:sourceDirty ?sourceDirtyRaw }
        OPTIONAL { ?evidence gall:independentReplay ?independentRaw }
      }
      BIND(COALESCE(STR(?crownRaw), "planning") AS ?crownId)
      BIND(COALESCE(?runnerRaw, -1) AS ?runner)
      BIND(COALESCE(?witnessRaw, -1) AS ?witness)
      BIND(COALESCE(?falsifierRaw, -1) AS ?falsifier)
      BIND(COALESCE(?receiptRaw, -1) AS ?receipt)
      BIND(COALESCE(?replayRaw, -1) AS ?replay)
      BIND(COALESCE(STR(?revisionRaw), "UNOBSERVED") AS ?revision)
      BIND(COALESCE(?sourceDirtyRaw, true) AS ?sourceDirty)
      BIND(COALESCE(?independentRaw, false) AS ?independent)
      BIND(
        IF(
          !BOUND(?evidence),
          "UNKNOWN",
          IF(
            ?runner = 0 && ?witness = 0 && ?falsifier = 0 &&
            ?receipt = 0 && ?replay = 0 &&
            ?sourceDirty = false && ?independent = true &&
            ?revision != "UNVERSIONED" && ?revision != "UNOBSERVED",
            "ALIVE",
            "PARTIAL_ALIVE"
          )
        ) AS ?standing
      )
    } ORDER BY ?checkpointId
---
# Gall Status Ledger

GENERATED by `ggen sync run`. Standing is derived from admitted evidence; it is never copied from `gall:declaredStanding`.

| Checkpoint | Crown | Standing | Revision | Runner | Witness | Falsifier | Receipt | Replay |
|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
{% for row in standings %}| `{{ row.checkpointId }}` — {{ row.title }} | `{{ row.crownId }}` | **{{ row.standing }}** | `{{ row.revision }}` | {{ row.runner }} | {{ row.witness }} | {{ row.falsifier }} | {{ row.receipt }} | {{ row.replay }} |
{% endfor %}

## State interpretation

- `UNKNOWN`: no admitted checkpoint evidence exists.
- `PARTIAL_ALIVE`: evidence exists, but at least one execution, falsifier, receipt, replay, revision, or clean-source obligation remains open.
- `ALIVE`: every executable obligation is green at an exact clean revision with detached-worktree replay.
- `UNSUPPORTED`, `BLOCKED`, and `BUILD_BROKEN` remain typed failure classifications for program-specific evidence extensions; they never collapse into `ALIVE`.
